  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb600e1d3e076b284e8e4b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又要比赛……？\r\n请给我一个合适的理由。\r\n否则的话我可没法接受！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2656ebdbc1d45fd151334f10e8e5bf59b11d3f5fe867947cb8e3c12e1af16a01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a458b97ee4063b35f176f94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会又要和我说什么比赛吧？\r\n你有好好考虑比赛日程吗？\r\n简直就像个傻瓜一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f27235c3565245fae3125424786f12fc1719d18fcc7089b306f0250349b1a5ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0480d3e1e808bc7a633bde5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，完美的不能再完美了♪\r\n现在的话感觉不会输给任何人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed9ea3e6a545e0d8f907b571227d4ad13968b983268c4ee588d18e95d52cd463",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a1785e5a8cf1d328828dc04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无可挑剔的绝佳状态！\r\n好好看着吧，我最棒的跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c980b54578c95bde0f2e22d552f0cb76076d28817db4b00b67b3dbf21ef3f74c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b1e85cd361dddc896bbfde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标除了第一之外别无他物！\r\n我一定会下赢比赛的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8799a2e9dbb09606a27ca865ba8d45cdb36d2bc3c756e70818a8eb8193d1c25a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:514ac841e2dc6ec91d87db67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，状态不错！\r\n剩下就是竭尽全力了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0bbf0e710f9dedc294fd1affc9faddbb9d2004e209b655701d73826f45545a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1917a3e609bce689bf202f9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这可是场很重要的比赛啊！\r\n状态也十分不错，\r\n我可不能输啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cdc0a19017208714185da3926ee043e3b02b27428a1c8ed2435bae0ba14963e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e69277a5e106498274291af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态很好！\r\n就请好好期待，我出色的表现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac961df8af1a9a08b09b60a061d7626b6bf5eecdc95d4a839bf0cdcdeeabb51",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e6a2091cca964ad9c7f8fa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了这场比赛\r\n我可是一直在努力。\r\n一定要赢给你看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c838ab3a3ab93402e3bb95f43564939ee257ad2b113cfc595b4db1b6fdd949",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1ed70a4b859f0e4c65aa34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体状况还不错。\r\n应该能够发挥出平时的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f832016b7c5c98f28d98afbc1edbeaba41e2a92c5d76c076d9b9e96d48164bc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fd2cae49b4fd0c823ae260f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可是很擅长大舞台的。\r\n紧张什么的肯定是不可能的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78728d48d7ec36bc1a993656a306961355351559cea723cc934b2f77d0e032dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57fd569142cbb953ea96d4ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么了？有什么不放心的？\r\n没问题，我会做到的。\r\n一定……没问题……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9002213ffa101bce0d512b8f9df0ef634eadeb5f3d8d96325c7be1ca607f32f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77da547a524acbb94796f32b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标比赛呢……\r\n不管状态如何，\r\n以第一名为目标是不会改变的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53e7a6142b076e43b1e34fd4d61f5b1bbb1fe669768f90d503f36544f13bbe43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4764e9488f9977c5bc4044c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可不能说泄气话啊。\r\n我只会贯彻我的跑法。\r\n仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57923580ab9f050cb356ccf8b7c477d88946cf87279988a7fb2433b735c9e3d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2638fe3f5b5576a7c8df57d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要以这个状态面对对手……\r\n真头疼啊……\r\n但是，不上不行呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2759e38eb3e2707971a709ccb34d7b0280855757f61162863837847a7d4264fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3602cc3763c7fd7f8b63cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我可不想拿状态来当借口……！\r\n既然以顶点为目标，无论什么时候\r\n都得好好跑下去……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd17fa394f8c01719fc60c05ba71c12d29a83d600748e7663aaf59e5ff59062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:716ecb3aa43c2849e113ff25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会就这样结束的……！\r\n我会击溃这窘境！\r\n顺带也战胜对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b90e0bb79d1b98551b5e431cfd84bb53b3a1839adab25003dee9035f6db014",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8523b1ccf929ea210b2058a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beac0611196f8962b4b57f8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0df3f2e0e77dc44f48db7193ffd6190e7e0a137386891752101ca66b6aeee273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4d52deab74a60d02da4a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03687149a07d502c5b9da8d1fcf236aa2a9f7cac483fc252307d9d3911de06c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e3e07d06b75a6035d662f57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "必须集中精神！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36ec8fbebacf2637473de28843f5956304e1b7b2bf41a294cfc701b030078988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4324bc947c0a94e1c3610ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奇怪了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4354968d449c99e6f8bafb19019db0740547616e78ccb3bff2129bd7e6699fb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba779df46b5138fba0824840",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我竟然犯了这种错误……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ad0fc41b31f9facb0204a8183e1fc073b3866e44c40e99fe681dbf1f75ba20c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65c966b658ee6a7d231bfe11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "778f2d205d4eaf97bc7ba75792626a5d8a4695e1fb0cb5ca44b7b560dd525d9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48f8cffa9e6ce43d233e6431",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "去海边吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12321e7a4ade58fdd6ddd2e1ab538f8c82aac461ae3b40d59f4615bd65c994ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
