    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54b66bb9267946684190b53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优雅地……获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5936e16e6080642644cdccc9e0929f64aaaf1839bd7ab876c17faa78f59cf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:015a94daa14681f2f3b73ecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能当上官方大使我是很高兴，\r\n但要跟她一起当啊……真是的，\r\n想也知道她铁定会给我添麻烦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8840d5a37fdf7dc85f601b56b51d3f86e1cb6bb15cf599ced372d04f368a8963",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19953753efb53a9b21743ec0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真期待大家一起出去玩♪\r\n那家伙得意忘形地拟定了很乱来的\r\n行程，所以我先调整过啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb266ecad075c7ba519033c8ab86ee8936b3b14a63581db05f24afe4723be6c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e5c963043a5c5b88a11251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在妈妈眼里，\r\n是个没用的孩子吗……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "100c6ec82d93890c94cd03617c2bf5e91c2c2a736ef4a6382aa3833be9a0b4f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd2e8ae3ed8a664e98bcd0bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶！\r\n根本完全没照我的计划发展！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c27941da8b36050dcdf2cb6ab1753ae7fc12b31645532c1d608fe6894d57de5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f3c6dcb196593e8372b845d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我现在所需要的东西，\r\n说不定，\r\n真的就在这里了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f40ad35c9ff8f264893d525a25732fcdcd118e0b7455ffcbe3e34bcbe9792ebf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de3c42f51b23f6ceeeb28010",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "优雅地……获得胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b5936e16e6080642644cdccc9e0929f64aaaf1839bd7ab876c17faa78f59cf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43410060db7052f2a8d23056",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能让妈妈感到开心真是太好了。\r\n……早知道就该拍张照才对的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33f4eebf2867cbe48051d318579705e21c0b85ff34e782547070480c9fc6bbbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b3c1d42472b61267f6b58b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是第一名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6247156a9a0b76356e0136e0e3195416fc33993157dc9ec53abcfdb62b2b2785",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b54a8dd962a7270e35a61888",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要比谁都更加闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3977003147929b8de9f4cb49ecbfd66a31e6de60912f261171135a627a4e9a2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4bc0e66edcd8e76822b4e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到就火大、心生烦躁，\r\n但又无法不去在意……\r\n所以，她才会是我的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb54251f88211f7fe0a7e305ab9cfb766e2f0dd8c3f90aefafb96ca5a47c279",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c895ac9405fd19fddfdde7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将在冰冷的黑暗之中，\r\n把最闪耀的光芒……赠送给你！\r\n……很温暖吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88a6780a7bed4665014933803915077f7250e9e3696021f6a4e4986715b1d5b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cddb44996f1022d3306f0c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的很蠢耶！平常吵吵闹闹的\r\n样子上哪去了！扭扭捏捏的……\r\n害我不知道怎么应付……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d35a69134fc29e744a5c32fb7aad2542b87d48b68b09522f0270ae17f4ef46f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "400053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:864db44fc54798dfe45a556d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c967e75e39f341bde454f3e389531a0943b2e9cb665d31e66635fcd79e310da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef19b9b025636e3157b0b385",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2deba7ca30c98238317c64bb01282f7578b945b19432461c4536c6681ac4b8ee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1527484792fa7b7a7969ab72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1fab47d8e7ed0746053c2a9d0db347e7f6e385026266c3908c56ab943f8993",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44b70b2dbc678f96d9933f6d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1fab47d8e7ed0746053c2a9d0db347e7f6e385026266c3908c56ab943f8993",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1009",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
